        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur CARSOL19, Soleil Knob with Carre Tall Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Soleil Knob with Carre 11 Inch Tall Plate is ideal for doors that are larger in height. This stunning Soleil Knob with Carre Tall Plate has an interesting design that has a transitional feel. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. The Carre Tall Plate with Soleil Knob is 11 inches tall and 2.5 inches wide. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/single-cylinder-soleil-knob-with-carre-tall-plate-entryset-grandeur-carsol19entr\"><b>Keyed Entry Soleil Knob with Carre Tall Plate.</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Soleil Knob with Carre Tall Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Carre Tall Plate with Soleil Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2.375\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.625\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-CARSOL19-specifications.pdf?v=1704262392\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur CARSOL19 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> Surfaced mounted, non-working knobs. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
